      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Eden Roc Cap Cana vs private villa for a large group: which is better?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "For a large group, a private villa. Villa Espada sleeps up to 22 guests in one estate on Fairway 5 of Punta Espada; in peak season 16 guests pay about $250 to $281 per person per night and 22 guests about $232, with a private chef, butler, daily housekeeping, airport transfers, two golf carts and the Punta Espada member-guest discounted rate included. Eden Roc suits couples and small parties who want a boutique Relais & Châteaux hotel with restaurants."
      }
    }\2
